    "body": "## Problem\n\nQuitting Nvim skips LSP clients still waiting for an `initialize` response, which can leave their server processes running.\n\nFixes #42440.\n\n## Solution\n\nInclude uninitialized clients in the exit handler's client list. Extend the existing client start/stop test to check that `VimLeavePre` stops a client before it initializes, reusing its server fixture.\n\nValidation: the full `lsp_spec.lua` run passes on macOS (145 passed, 4 skipped). Temporarily reverting the exit-handler change makes the integrated regression fail.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-11-01T14:41:42Z",
